Clock_Calendar_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the period is WEEK
│   └── it should return t times WEEK_UNITS_PER_SECOND
├── when the period is MONTH or YEAR
│   ├── it should return the month index times MONTH_UNITS plus the seconds into the month times LCM_DAYS divided by the days in the month
│   ├── given t is the first second of a month
│   │   └── it should return exactly the month index times MONTH_UNITS
│   ├── given t is the last second of a month
│   │   └── it should return less than the next month index times MONTH_UNITS
│   └── given t is in February of a leap year
│       └── it should count 29 days so the month still runs exactly MONTH_UNITS
└── when the period is not WEEK or MONTH or YEAR
    └── it should revert with InvalidPeriod
